@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create Order (Success -> 201 Created)
# Server automatically computes price_at_order and total_amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "qty": 2 },
    { "product_id": 2, "qty": 1 }
  ]
}

### 2. Create Order Fails - Insufficient Stock (Error -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "qty": 9999 }
  ]
}

### 3. Create Order Fails - Customer Not Found (Error -> 404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 99999,
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "qty": 1 }
  ]
}

### 4. Create Order Fails - Product Not Found (Error -> 404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 99999, "qty": 1 }
  ]
}

### 5. Get Order Detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1

### 6. Get Order Detail Not Found (Error -> 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/99999

### 7. List All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### 8. List Orders Filtered by Customer ID (?customer_id=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?customer_id=1

### 9. List Orders Filtered by Status (?status=PENDING)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=PENDING

### 10. Update Order Status PENDING -> PAID (Success -> 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAID"
}

### 11. Update Order Status PAID -> SHIPPED (Success -> 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SHIPPED"
}

### 12. Update Order Status SHIPPED -> COMPLETED (Success -> 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 13. Create New Order to Test Cancellation
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "qty": 3 }
  ]
}

### 14. Cancel Order PENDING -> CANCELLED (Restores Item Stock Atomically)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

### 15. Invalid Status Transition (Error -> 409 Conflict)
# Attempting to transition completed order #1 to PAID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAID"
}
